      "writtenOn": "2016-12-09T22:05:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah I guess you\u0027re right. With this change it will only catch images that cause a rolling reboot not images that break TPM functionality.\n\nWe need a way to verify the TPM is good and shouldn\u0027t push this change.",
