      "writtenOn": "2016-12-09T22:29:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not mixing it up. I\u0027m just noting that notion of rollback protection from any bad firmware (aside from rolling reboots) won\u0027t work any more. As I said I think it\u0027s important to note that aspect in the description. That\u0027s all.",
      "parentUuid": "9a3cf3c1_b0c1913e",
      "revId": "4cedf193028ad6ac39b35b6d95425a914324a298",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
